    {
      "type": "prose",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "The code is packaged as a library (specifically “janus.library”), which is loaded during Autoconfig procedure.",
      "bbox": [
        889,
        1967,
        2127,
        2074
      ],
      "segment_id": "page_0083_seg_009"
    },
    {
      "type": "prose",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "All routines that return a value return it in D0. There is a link library for C routines, “jlib.lib”.",
      "bbox": [
        891,
        2118,
        2134,
        2224
      ],
      "segment_id": "page_0083_seg_010"
    },
    {
      "type": "code_block",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "```text\noldHandler = SetJanusHandler( jintnum,  intserver  )\n                               D0        A1\n```",
      "bbox": [
        891,
        2268,
        2007,
        2359
      ],
      "segment_id": "page_0083_seg_011"
    },
    {
      "type": "prose",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "This routine sets up an interrupt handler for a particular janus interrupt. The old interrupt is returned. A null means that there is no interrupt handler. If there is no interrupt handler then interrupts not will be processed for that jintnum.",
      "bbox": [
        891,
        2417,
        2133,
        2626
      ],
      "segment_id": "page_0083_seg_012"
    },
    {
      "type": "code_block",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "```text\noldEnable = SetJanusEnable( jintnum, newvalue )\n                             D0       D1\n```",
      "bbox": [
        894,
